hadiths[95]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4064","'ady by۔ hatm nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya kh jb tm apnay ktay kw chhwr dw tw khda ka nam lay awr agr wh tmhyn kwyy chyz pkray awr tm zndh hw tw as kay pas aao awr as ka gla kat dw، agr tm as kay pas aao jb ktay nay asay mara hw lykn as myn say kchh nh khaya hw asay khao، lykn agr as nay as myn say kchh khaya hw tw asay nh khao، kywnkh as nay apnay lyay dwsray kw tlash kya hay awr agr as nay apnay aap kw mar dala hay tw as ka gla kat dw۔ bnaya gya hay، nh khao، kywnkh tm nhyn jantay kh an myn say ks janwr kw mara hay jb tm apna tyr chlatay hw awr agr ayk dn kay lyay tmhary nzrwn say awjhl hw jayay awr tm kw as myn srf tyr ka nshan nzr aayay tw khao، lykn agr tm asay pany myn dwba hwa pao tw mt khao۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4065","as nay kha kh as nay khda kay rswl kw btaya kh as nay trbyt yafth ktwn kw rwanh kya، awr as nay jwab dya، \jw wh tmharay lyay pkrtay hyn asay khao۔\"" as nay pwchha kh kya as ka atlaq hwta hay yhan tk kh agr anhwn nay khyl kw mar dala ، awr as nay jwab dya kh aysa hwa۔ as nay asay btaya kh as nay bghyr pnkhwn kay tyr maray hyn* tw as nay jwab dya: \""jw wh chhydtay hyn asay khao، lykn js chyz kw wh drmyany hsay say martay hyn awr martay hyn wh mara mara jata hay، lhza asay nh khao۔\"" *mrad drmyan myn mwta awr srwn pr ptla tha۔ janwr kw as kay drmyany hsay say marna wajb tha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4066","abw salbh khshny rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh anhwn nay kha: \khda kay rswl، hm ayk aysay mlk myn hyn jw ahl ktab hyn، tw kya hm an kay brtnwn myn say kchh kha sktay hyn؟ ayk shkary alaqay myn myn apny kman say shkar krta hwn، myra kta jw trbyt yafth nhyn hay awr myra kta jw trbyt yafth nhyn hay، tw myray lyay kya shyh hay؟\"" aap nay frmaya: ahl ktab kay brtnwn kay baray myn jw kchh tm nay byan kya hay، agr tmhyn kchh mlay tw an myn say nh khao، lykn agr nh krskw tw an kw dhw kr kha lw، allh ka nam lay kr apny kman say jw pkrw asay khao، jb allh ka nam lya hw tw apnay trbyt yafth ktay say jw pkrw asay khao، awr jb bly kay pas mwjwd hw tw asay marw۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4067","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh \jb tm apna tyr marw awr janwr tmhary nzrwn say awjhl hw jayay tw jb tm as pr aao tw asay kha lw، bshrtykh as myn bdbw nh hw۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4068","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh wh as shkhs kay baray myn jw tyn dn bad as khyl myn aata hay jsay as nay gwly mary hay، \asay khao، bshrtykh as myn bdbw nh hw۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4069","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh kchh lwgwn nay kha: allh kay rswl، yhan kchh lwg hyn، jw hal hy myn shrk say bdlay hwyay hyn، jw hmaray lyay gwsht latay hyn awr hm nhyn jantay kh as pr allh ka nam lya hay ya nhyn۔ as nay jwab dya kh khda ka nam lya krw awr khao۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4070","abwtfyl khtay hyn kh aly say pwchha gya kh kya khda kay rswl nay anhyn apnay lyay kwyy hdayt dy hay tw jwab dya kh aap nay anhyn kwyy aysy hdayt nhyn dy jw tmam lwgwn pr lagw nh hw swayay as kay jw an ky tlwar myn thy۔ as kay bad as nay ayk dstawyz nkaly js myn lkha tha: \khda as pr lant kray jw ksy janwr kw khda kay alawh ksy awr ka zkr krtay hwyay maray، awr khda as pr lant kray jw nshan chwry kray!\"" ayk wrzhn myn hay، \""jw ayk nshan kw tbdyl krta hay؛ khda as pr lant kray jw apnay bap pr lant kray؛ awr khda as pr lant kray jw bdat ky hfazt krta hay!\"" *yany nby sly allh alyh wslm kay khandan kay afrad mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4071","rfya by۔ khdyj nay byan kya kh as nay kha: \khda kay rswl، hm kl dshmn say mlyn gay awr hmaray pas chhryan nhyn hyn، kya hm chhrywn say janwrwn kw mar sktay hyn؟\"" * as nay jwab dya، \""jb allh ka nam lya jayay tw aap as chyz kw kha sktay hyn js say khwn nklta hay، swayay dant awr pnjay kay، myn aap kw as kay baray myn btaon ga، dant ayk hdy hay awr pnjwn ka pnjh hay۔\"" hmaray pas kchh awnt awr bhyryn ghnymt kay twr pr aayyn، jb awntwn myn say ayk bhag gya tw ayk aadmy nay as pr tyr mara awr asay bhagnay say rwk dya، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ’’awntwn myn kchh aysay bhy hyn jw jngly janwrwn ky trh thltay hyn، ps jb an myn say kwyy tm myn say bhtr hw tw an kay sath aysa krw۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4072","kab b malk nay btaya kh as kay pas bhyryn thyn jw sal myn chrayy gyy thyn، [mdynh kay qryb ayk phary] awr jb an ky ayk lwndy nay an ky ayk bkry kw mrtay hwyay dykha tw as nay ayk pthr twr dya awr as say as ka gla kat dya۔ as nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say swal kya tw aap nay asay khanay ka hkm dya۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4073","shdad by۔ aws nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan krtay hwyay kha kh allh taalyٰ nay hkm dya hay kh hr kam achhay tryqay say kya jayay، as lyay jb tm qtl krw tw achha tryqh astamal krw awr jb ksy janwr ka gla katw tw achha tryqh astamal krw، kywnkh tm myn say hr ayk kw chahyay kh apny chhry kw tyz kray awr janwr kw jtna hwskay tklyf day۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4074","abn amr rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw ksy janwr ya ksy awr chyz kw marnay kay antzar myn rkhnay say mna frmaya tha۔ * lfz ka trjmh krdh janwr bhymh hay، jw kh chwgny ky trf asharh krta hay۔ \kwyy awr chyz\"" ka mtlb hay dwsry mkhlwqat jw khanay kay lyay mary jaty hyn۔ mmanat ka hwalh ya tw aysay janwrwn kw bghyr khanay pynay kay rkhnay، ya anhyn qyd krnay awr anhyn nshanh bnanay kay lyay kha jata hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4075","anhwn nay btaya kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay an lwgwn pr lant bhyjy hay jw ksy jandar kw nshanh bnatay hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4076","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy jandar kw nshanh nh bnao۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4077","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay chhray pr marnay awr chhray pr dagh lganay say mna frmaya hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4078","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya jb ayk gdha js kay chhray pr dagh lga hwa tha، aap sly allh alyh wslm kay pas say gzra، \khda ky lant hw as pr js nay dagh lgaya tha۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4079","ans nay byan kya kh ayk sbh wh abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh kw lay gyay۔ abwtlhh rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw kchh chbanay awr as say apna talw rgrnay kay lyay * awr dykha kh as kay hath myn lwhay ka nshan tha js myn sdqh kay awntwn kw nshan lga rhay thay۔ *yh awlad kay lyay brkt kay hswl kay lyay ayk rwaj tha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4080","hsham by۔ zyd nay ans ka hwalh dytay hwyay kha kh wh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm ky ayadt kay lyay gyay jb wh ayk dywar myn thay awr aap kw bhyr kw daghtay hwyay dykha۔ as nay swcha kh as nay kha yh an kay kanwn pr hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4081","'ady by۔ hatm nay byan kya kh as nay kha: mjhay btao، khda kay rswl، jb hm myn say kwyy khyl pkray awr as kay pas chhry nh hw tw kya wh chqmaq awr lathy say as ka gla kat skta hay؟ as nay jwab dya kh jw kchh bhy lw awr allh ka nam lw as kay sath khwn bhao۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4082","abwalashrh* nay apnay wald say nql kya hay kh anhwn nay kha kh kya zbh krna srf hlq awr synh kay awpry hsay myn hay؟ as nay jwab dya kh agr tm as ky ran myn chhyd krw gay tw yh tmharay kam aayay gy۔ *wh asamh bn thay۔ mlk b۔ qhtm (ya qhtm)۔ dykhyay abn abd albr۔ asthazh، s۔ 246، nmbr 10S9۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod، nsayy، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔ abwdaod nay kha kh knwyn myn grnay walay janwr kw zbh krnay ka yh tryqh hay، awr trmzy nay kha hay kh yh zrwrt kay wqt hay۔"
"4083","'ady by۔ hatm rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kchh tmharay lyay ktay ya baz nay pkra hay asay khao awr jb tm nay khda ka nam lya hw tw asay chhwr dw۔ as nay pwchha kh kya as ka atlaq hwta hay agr as nay janwr kw mar dala tw as nay jwab dya kh jb wh as myn say kchh khayay bghyr asay marta hay tw as nay srf tmharay lyay pkra hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4084","as nay btaya kh as nay kha، \khda kay rswl، myn khyl myn chlata hwn awr aglay dn as myn apna tyr tlash krta hwn۔\"" as nay jwab dya kh jb tmhyn malwm hw kh tmharay tyr nay asay mara hay awr as janwr pr ksy shkary janwr ka nshan nhyn hay tw tm asay kha sktay hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4085","jabr nay kha kh wh mmnwah khyl thay jsay mjwsywn kay ktay nay pkra tha۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4086","abw salbh khshny nay byan kya kh anhwn nay kha kh allh kay rswl hm sfr krtay hyn awr jb hm yhwdywn، aysayywn awr mjwsywn kay pas aatay hyn tw hmyn an kay brtnwn kay swa kchh nhyn mlta۔ as nay jwab dya kh agr tmhyn kchh nh mlay tw an kw pany say dhw lw awr phr an myn say khao pyw۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4087","qbysh b۔ hlb nay apnay wald ka hwalh dytay hwyay kha kh anhwn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say aysayywn kay khanay kay baray myn pwchha، (ayk nskhh js myn kha gya hay kh yh ayk aadmy tha js nay an say pwchha tha)، anhwn nay mzyd kha kh yh ayk qsm ka khana tha js say wh dwr rhtay thay۔ as nay jwab dya، \bay shk apnay synh myn dakhl hwnay dw js say tm aysayyt say mshabht rkhtay hw۔\"" * * aam fhm yh hay kh aysa khana jayz hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4088","abwdrdaa khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjthmh kw khanay say mna frmaya hay، jw tyrwn ka nshanh bnnay wala janwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4089","alarbad b۔ saryh nay byan kya kh khybr kay dn khda kay rswl nay hr gwsht khwr janwr js kay dant hwn، hr pnjh walay prnday، ghrylw gdhwn ka gwsht، mjthmh، khlsh awr hamlh khwatyn say as wqt tk mbashrt krnay say mna kya jb tk kh wh bchh nh lay jayyn۔ mhmd by yhyyٰ* nay kha kh abwaasm say mjtma kay baray myn pwchha gya tw anhwn nay kha kh as ka mtlb prndh ya kwyy awr chyz hay js kw khra kr kay gwly mar dy jayay۔ as say khlsh kay baray myn pwchha gya awr kha kh yh wh janwr hay jsay ksy bhyryay ya shkary drnday say lya gya hay js nay asay pkr lya hay lykn asay zbh krnay say phlay hy as kay hath myn mr jata hay۔ *trmzy ky fwry snd۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4090","abn abas awr abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay shytan ky qrbany say mna frmaya hay۔ abn aysyٰ* nay mzyd kha kh as say mrad wh zbh shdh janwr hay js ky khal kat dy jaty hay awr phr asay mrnay kay lyay chhwr dya jata hay awr as ky rgwn kw kata jata hay۔ *sy ayf۔ abwdaod، adhy، 17۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4091","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jnyn ka zbh as wqt bhy shaml hay jb as ky man kw zbh kya jayay۔ asay abwdaod awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4092","asay trmzy nay abw sayd say rwayt kya hay۔"
"4093","abwsayd khdry rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh anhwn nay arz kya ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hm awntny ka gla kattay hyn awr ayk gayay awr bkry zbh krtay hyn awr as kay rhm myn jnyn paya jata hay، kya hm asay phynk dyn ya kha lyn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: agr tm chahw tw kha lw، kywnkh as ky man kw zbh krnay myn as ka zbh bhy shaml hay۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4094","abdallh by۔ amrw by۔ jysa kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt hay kh agr kwyy chrya ya as say bry chyz kw nahq maray tw allh taalyٰ as say as kay qtl kay baray myn swal kray ga۔ yh pwchhnay pr kh shyh tryqh kya hay as nay jwab dya kh as ka gla kat kr kha lya jayay lykn as ka sr kat kr phynkna nhyn۔ ahmd، nsayy awr darmy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4095","abw waqd lysy rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm mdynh tshryf layay tw lwg awntwn kay kwhan kattay thay awr bkrywn ky mwty dmyn kattay thay، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js janwr kw kata jayay wh zndh hw wh mrdh hay* awr asay nhyn khana chahyay۔ *yany as kay sath aysa slwk kya jata hay jw qdrty mwt say mr gyy thy، awr as lyay asay hlal twr pr nhyn khaya ja skta۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4096","'ata' b۔ ysar kw by harsh kay ayk shkhs nay btaya kh jb wh ahd ky ayk ghaty myn hamlh awntny kw chra rha tha tw as nay dykha kh wh mrnay waly hay awr as kay glay kw katnay kay lyay kwyy chyz nh mlnay ky wjh say as nay dao pr lga kr as kay synh kay awpry hsay myn ghwnp dya yhan tk kh as ka khwn bhnay lga۔ as kay bad as nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw khbr dy awr aap nay asay khanay ka hkm dya۔ abwdaod awr malk nay asay rwayt kya hay۔ apnay wrzhn myn as nay kha kh as nay asay lkry kay nwkylay tkray say zbh kya۔"
"4097","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”smndr myn kwyy aysa janwr nhyn jsay allh taalyٰ nay bny aadm kay lyay zbh nh kya hw۔ darqtny nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4098","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kwyy kta palay، swayay bkry kay ktay ya shkar kay lyay trbyt yafth، tw as kay nyk aamal myn say rwzanh dw qyrat km kyay jayyn gay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4099","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay bhyr ktay ya shkary ktay ya khyty kay ktay kw chhwr kr kta pala tw as kay swab myn say rwzanh ayk qyrat kata jayay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4100","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn ktwn kw marnay ka hkm dya awr hm ayk ktay kw bhy mar rhay thay jsay ayk awrt shra say apnay sath layy thy۔ as kay bad khda kay rswl nay hmyn ktwn kw marnay say mna krtay hwyay kha kh \apnay aap kw as qsm tk mhdwd rkhw jw khals syah hay awr as myn dw dhbay hyn، kywnkh yh shytan hay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4101","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ktwn kw marnay ka hkm dya، swayay shkary ktay ya bhyr ktay ya janwrwn ky dykh bhal kay lyay astamal kyay janay walay ktwn kay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4102","abdallh by mghfl rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr ktay mkhlwq ky ayk qsm nh hwtay tw myn hkm dyta kh an sb kw qtl kr dya jayay، lykn hr khals syah kw mar dalw“۔ asay abwdaod awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔ trmzy awr nsayy nay mzyd kha: \kwyy bhy khandan apnay aap kw ktay say nhyn lgata hay jb tk kh as kay aamal ka ayk qyrat rwzanh kata jata hay، swayay shkary ktay، khyty kay ktay ya bhyr ktay kay۔\"""""""
"4103","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay janwrwn kw ayk dwsray say lrnay pr aksanay say mna frmaya hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4104","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy bhy dant dar janwr ka shkar krna hram hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4105","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hr shkary hywan kw dantwn say awr hr prnday kw tylh say mna frmaya hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4106","abw salbh nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ghrylw gdhwn kay gwsht say mna frmaya hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4107","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay khybr kay dn ghrylw gdhwn kay gwsht say mna frmaya، lykn ghwray kay gwsht ky ajazt dy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4108","abw qtadh nay byan kya kh myn nay ayk jngly gdhay kw dykha awr asay mar dala۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha kh kya an kay pas as ka gwsht hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh an ky ayk tang hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay lay kr kha lya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4109","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hm nay mrr alzhran myn ayk khrgwsh shrwa kya awr jb myn asay pkr kr abw tlhh kay pas laya tw as nay as ka gla kat dya awr as ky kry awr dw tangyn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas bhyj dyn، aap nay asay qbwl kr lya۔ 1. mkh kay qryb ayk wady۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4110","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn nh tw chhpkly khata hwn awr nh mna krta hwn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4111","abn abas nay kha kh anhyn khald bn nay btaya۔ wlyd khta hay kh wh khda kay rswl kay sath mymwnh ky ayadt kay lyay gyay jw an ky awr abn abas ky phwphy thyn awr dykha kh as kay pas ayk bhny hwyy chhpkly hay۔ as nay chhpkly kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay pysh kya، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as say hath hta lya tw khald rzy allh anh nay pwchha kh kya chhpkly hram hay؟ as nay jwab dya، ''nhyn۔ lykn myry qwm ky srzmyn myn kwyy nhyn tha، awr mjhay malwm hwa kh myn anhyn napsnd krta hwn۔‘‘ khald nay kha: phr myn nay asay chba kr khaya jb kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mjhay dykh rhay thay۔‘‘ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4112","abw mwsyٰ nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw prndh khatay dykha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4113","abn aby awfy nay byan kya kh wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath sat mhmat pr gyay awr aap kay sath tdy khayy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4114","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn: myn as mhm pr tha kh lshkr kw khanay kay lyay drkhtwn kay ptay marnay pray awr abw abydh rzy allh anh kw zmh dary swnpy gyy۔ hmyn shdyd bhwk ka samna krna pra، awr phr smndr nay ayk aysy mrdh mchhly kw phynk dya jsay hm nay phlay kbhy nhyn dykha tha، jsay asprmasyty whyl khtay hyn، awr hm nay aadha mhynh asay khaya۔ abw abydh nay as ky ayk hdy lay ly awr ayk swar as kay nychay say gzrnay myn kamyab hwgya۔ jb hm phnchay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as ka zkr kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw rzq allh nay tmharay lyay nkala hay asay khao، awr agr tmharay pas kchh hw tw hmyn bhy khla dw“، anhwn nay kha kh anhwn nay as myn say kchh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas bhyja tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay kha lya (bkhary w mslm)"
"4115","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb ksy kay brtn myn mkhy atray tw asay chahyay kh as myn sb kw dbw day awr phr phynk day، kywnkh as kay ayk pr myn shfa hay awr dwsray myn bymary hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4116","mymwnh nay kha kh jb ayk chwha kchh saf mkhn myn gra awr mr gya tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as kay baray myn pwchha gya tw aap nay frmaya kh asay phynk dw awr jw kchh as kay grd hay awr jw bcha hay asay kha lw۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4117","abn amr rzy allh anhma nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”sanpwn kw marw، dw lkyrwn walay awr chhwty dm walay kw marw، kywnkh wh bynayy kw khtm kr dytay hyn awr asqat hml ka baas bntay hyn۔ abdallh [yany abn amr khtay hyn kh jb myn sanp ka pychha kr rha tha awr asay marnay ky kwshsh kr rha tha tw abw lbabh nay asay pkara kh asay nh marw، lykn as nay jwab dya kh allh kay rswl nay sanp kw marnay ka hkm dya hay۔ as kay bad as nay kha kh as nay bad myn ghrylw sanpwn kw marnay say mna kr dya tha، kywnkh wh rhnay walay jn hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4118","abwsayb nay kha: hm abw sayd khdry ky ayadt kay lyay gyay awr hm bythay hwyay thay kh hm nay an kay swfay kay nychay ayk hrkt sny۔ jb hm nay dykha awr as myn sanp paya tw myn nay asay marnay kay lyay chhlang lga dy، lykn abw sayd jw nmaz myn msrwf thay، nay mjhay bythnay ka asharh kya، chnanchh myn byth gya۔ jb wh fargh hwa tw as nay ghr kay ayk kmray ky trf asharh kya awr pwchha kh kya myn nay asay dykha hay، awr jb myn nay kha kh myn nay kya tw as nay btaya kh an kay ayk nwkr nay js ky hal hy myn shady ky thy، as pr qbzh kr lya hay۔ wh khda kay rswl kay sath khndq ky trf nklay awr wh nwjwan khda kay rswl say ajazt mang rha tha kh aadha dn rhnay kay bad whan say nkl jayay awr apny bywy kay pas waps aajayay۔ ayk dn jb as nay khda kay rswl say ajazt tlb ky tw as nay asay kha kh wh apnay hthyar apnay sath lay jayay kywnkh asay khdshh tha kh qryzh asay nqsan phncha skta hay۔ wh aadmy apnay hthyar lay kr waps aaya awr apny bywy kw dw drwazwn kay drmyan khra dykh kr asay hsd ka nshanh bnaya awr asay apny lans say chhydnay pr mjbwr kya، lykn as nay asay kha kh wh apny nyzh kw hta day awr ghr myn dakhl hw kr dykhay kh asay ks chyz nay bahr nkala hay۔ andr dakhl hwa tw ayk bra sanp charpayy pr dnda pra hwa paya، tw as nay lans say asay bnaya awr as say swrakh kya awr phr bahr ja kr asay ghr ky zmyn myn gar dya، lykn sanp nay lrz kr as pr hmlh kr dya awr ksy kw malwm nh hwa kh an myn say kwn phlay mr gya، sanp ya jwan۔ wh khda kay rswl kay pas gyay awr as waqah ka zkr as say kya awr as say kha kh khda say daa kryn kh wh an kay lyay asay zndh kray، lykn as nay jwab dya، \apnay dwst kay lyay maafy mangw۔\"" phr frmaya kh an ghrwn myn jnat rhtay hyn، as lyay jb tm an myn say ksy kw dykhw tw asay tyn bar tnbyh krw، 1 agr wh chla jayay tw thyk hay، wrnh asay mar dalw، kywnkh yh kafr hay۔‘‘ phr an say kha kh jao awr apnay dwst kw dfn krw، ayk rwayt myn kha gya hay kh ’’mdynh myn jnat hyn jnhwn nay aslam qbwl kya hay، as lyay jb tm asay tyn dn kay lyay jng ka aalan krw gay tw asay dykhw۔ as kay bad tm asay mar dalw kywnkh yh srf shytan hay۔\"" 1. hyryjyw alyha thlythn۔ fal ka mtlb hay chyzwn kw mshkl bnana۔ as jmlay ka mfhwm yh hay kh sanp kw tyn bar btana chahyay kh agr wh waps aajayay tw wh mshkl myn pray ga، awr agr as tnbyh kay bad asay bhga kr mar dya jayay tw as pr alzam nhyn lgana chahyay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4119","am shryk nay btaya kh khda kay rswl nay chhpklywn kw marnay ka hkm dya، yh khtay hwyay kh chhpkly nay abrahym pr phwnk mary۔ as rwayt myn kha gya hay kh chhpkly nay aag kw hlanay kay lyay as pr phwnk mary۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4120","sad b۔ abw wqas rzy allh anh nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay chhpklywn kw marnay ka hkm dya awr anhyn khtrnak chhwty mkhlwq qrar dya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4121","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs phly zrb say chhpkly kw maray ga as kay lyay sw nykyan lkhy jayyn gy، agr dwsry bar maray tw as say km awr tysry zrb pr as say bhy km۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4122","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh jb ayk nby kw chywnty nay dnk mara tw as nay chywntywn ky kalwny kw jlanay ka hkm dya، awr khdayay bzrg w brtr nay as pr why ky، \chwnty nay tmhyn dnk marnay ky wjh say tm nay ayk aysy jmaat kw jla dya hay jw myry shan byan krty hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4123","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb chwha thws mkhn myn gr jayay tw as chwhay kw phynk dw awr jw kchh as kay ard grd hay، lykn agr wh maya halt myn hw tw as kay qryb nh jao۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4124","darmy nay asay abn abas rzy allh anh say rwayt kya hay۔"
"4125","sfynh nay btaya kh as nay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay bstrd ka gwsht khaya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4126","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay gndgy khanay walay janwr kw khanay ya as ka dwdh pynay say mna frmaya hay۔ trmdhy nay asay mntql kya۔ abwdaod ky rwayt myn hay kh anhwn nay gndgy khanay walay janwr pr swar hwnay say mna kya hay۔"
"4127","abdalrhmn by۔ shbl khtay hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay chhpkly ka gwsht khanay say mna frmaya hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4128","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay blywn kw khanay say mna frmaya hay ya an kay lyay jw ajrt hay۔ 1 1. yh ya tw wh chyz hw skty hay jw qsm myn ada ky gyy thy، ya jw an kay lyay ada ky gyy rqm say khrydy gyy thy۔ asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4129","anhwn nay khybr kay dn ka zkr krtay hwyay kha kh khda kay rswl nay ghrylw gdhay، khchrwn ka gwsht، dantwn say shkar krnay wala hr janwr awr hr ayk prnday kw hram qrar dya۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4130","khald by۔ alwald nay kha kh khda kay rswl nay ghwrwn، khchrwn awr gdhwn ka gwsht khanay say mna frmaya hay۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4131","**Jubair bin Mut'im (Radi Allahu Anhu)** ne bayan kiya ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath Ghazwa-e-Khaibar mein shirkat karne gaye. Yahood aaye aur shikayat ki ke logon ne unki kachhi (hari) khajoor lena shuru kar di. Tab Allah kay Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jin logon se mu'ahida hai unka maal un par waajib haq (jizya/lagaan) ke alawah kisi ke liye halal nahi hai.\"" (Abu Dawud)."""""
"4132","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dw qsm kay janwr jw qdrty twr pr mray hyn awr dw qsm ka khwn hmaray lyay hlal kya gya hay، wh dw jw qdrty mwt say mrtay hyn wh mchhly awr tdy hyn، awr khwn ky dw qsmyn jgr awr tly hyn۔ asay ahmd، abn majh awr darqtny nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4133","abwzbyr nay jabr ky snd say as qwl kw nql kya hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \js chyz kw smndr phynk day awr jwar say rh jayay asay tm kha sktay hw، lykn jw smndr myn mr jayay awr tyray wh tm nh khao\""۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay nql kya hay، lykn mhy alsn nay kha hay kh aksr lwgwn ka khyal hay kh yh jabr say zyadh pychhay nhyn hay۔"""""
"4134","slman rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm say tdy dl kay baray myn pwchha gya tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh yh allh kay lshkrwn myn sb say zyadh hyn، myn anhyn nh khata hwn awr nh hy an kw hram qrar dyta hwn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay lykn mhy alsn nay asay zayf kha hay۔"
"4135","zyd by۔ khald nay kha kh khda kay rswl nay mrgh kw galy dynay say mna kya hay، yh khtay hwyay kh yh nmaz kay lyay sy aych kw bna rha hay۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"4136","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh \mrgh kw galy nh dw، kywnkh yh lwgwn kw nmaz kay lyay bydar krta hay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4137","abdalrhmn by۔ abw lylyٰ۔ abw lylyٰ rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb ksy ghr myn sanp nzr aayay tw as say khw kh hm tjh say nwh kay ahd awr slyman bn daod kay sath kyay gyay ahd kay zryaay swal krtay hyn kh hmyn kwyy nqsan nh phnchana، phr agr wh waps aayay tw asay mar dalw“۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4138","akrmh nay abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt ky kh anhyn yqyn hay kh myn nay asay nby sly allh alyh wslm say nql kya hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm sanpwn kw marnay ka hkm dytay thay awr frmaya krtay thay kh jw shkhs an kw as khwf say chhwr dyta hay kh kwyy bdlh lynay aayay ga wh hm myn say nhyn hay۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"4139","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hm nay an say slh nhyn ky jb say hm an say lray hyn، lhza js nay an myn say ksy kw dr kr tnha chhwr dya wh hm myn say nhyn hay۔ 1. yany sanp۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4140","abn msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmam sanpwn kw mar dalw، awr jw an kay bdlay say drta hay wh mjh say nhyn“۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4141","abas rzy allh anh nay kha، \khda kay rswl، hm zmzm kw jharna chahtay hyn، lykn as myn kchh jnat hyn،\"" yany chhwtay sanp؛ chnanchh khda kay rswl nay anhyn qtl krnay ka hkm dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4142","abn msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmam sanpwn kw mar dalw swayay as chhwtay sfyd kay jw chandy ky chhry ky trh dkhayy dyta hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4143","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say ksy kay brtn myn mkhy atray tw asay dbw dw، kywnkh as kay ayk pr myn bymary hay awr dwsray myn shfa hay، wh bymary walay kw aagay lay jaty hay، lhza asay dbw dw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4144","abwsayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb mkhy khanay pr chrhty hay tw asay dbw dyty hay، kywnkh as kay ayk pr myn zhr hwta hay awr dwsray myn shfa hwty hay، awr wh zhr kw phlay awr dwa kw dwsray pr rkhty hay۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"4145","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay char mkhlwqat kw marnay say mna frmaya: chywnty، shhd ky mkhyan، hwpw awr chrya kay bazw۔ asay abwdaod awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4146","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh zmanh jahlyt kay lwg baz chyzwn kw napak smjh kr khatay thay awr baz kw tnha chhwr dytay thay۔ phr khda nay apnay nby kw bhyja awr apny ktab nazl ky js myn baz chyzwn kw hlal awr baz kw hram qrar dya۔ lhza js chyz kw as nay hlal kya wh hlal hay، js chyz kw as nay hram kya wh hram hay، awr js kay baray myn as nay kchh nhyn kha wh jayz nhyn۔ awr as nay tlawt ky، ''khh dw kh jw kchh mjh pr nazl kya gya hay as myn jw asay khata hay as pr myn kwyy chyz hram nhyn pata، swayay mrdar ya khwn kay''۔''"
"4147","zahr alaslmy nay kha kh wh gmlwn kay nychay aag jla rha tha js myn gdhwn ka gwsht tha jb khda kay rswl kay pkarnay walay nay aalan kya kh khda kay rswl nay lwgwn pr gdhwn ka gwsht hram kr dya hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4148","abw salbh khshny nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka yh frman nql kya hay kh jnat tyn qsm kay hyn، ayk wh jn kay pr hyn awr wh hwa myn artay hyn، ayk wh jw sanpwn awr ktwn pr mshtml hay awr ayk wh jw jghwn pr thhray hwyay hyn awr sfr krtay hyn۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"4149","slman by۔ amyraldbl nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh \lrkay kay sath aqyqh bhy hwta hay، lhza as ky trf say khwn bhao awr as say zkhm dwr krw۔\""* *as ky mkhtlf trh say wzaht ky gyy hay kh bchay kay bal mwndna، ya pydaysh kay wqt as ky njast kw dwr krna، ya htyٰ kh khtnh krna۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"4150","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas lrkwn kw laya jata tha awr aap sly allh alyh wslm an pr drwd bhyjtay thay awr kchh khjwryn nrm kr kay an kay talw kw rgrtay thay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4151","asmaa bnt abwbkr rzy allh anh nay kha kh an ka hml abdallh bn gya۔ zbyr kw mkh myn rkha awr qba myn jna، phr asay rswl allh kay pas lay gyay awr apny gwd myn btha lya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay khjwr mngwayy، chba kr aap kay mnh myn thwk dya، as kay bad aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay talw kw rgra، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm kay lyay daa ky awr aap sly allh alyh wslm pr drwd bhyja۔ wh aslamy dwr myn pyda hwnay walay phlay bchay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4152","am krz nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khtay hwyay sna kh prndwn kw an kay bsnay myn rhnay dw۔* anhwn nay btaya kh as nay aap kw yh khtay hwyay bhy sna hay kh dw bhyryn lrkay ky trf say awr ayk lrky ky trf say qrban ky jayyn lykn as say aap kw kwyy nqsan nhyn hwga khwah wh nr hwn ya madh۔ *ya tw yh kh an say chhyr chhar nh ky jayay، ya yh kh anhyn shgwn lynay kay lyay pryshan nh kya jayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ trmzy awr nsayy asay \dw bkrywn\"" say aakhr tk nql krtay hyn، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh shyh rwayt hay۔"""""
"4153","alhsn nay smwrh ka hwalh dya js nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan kya kh \ayk lrka apnay aqyqh kay lyay grwy hay، satwyn dn as kay lyay qrbany ky jaty hay، as ka nam rkha jata hay awr as ka sr mndwaya jata hay۔\"" ahmd، trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay asay nql kya hay، lykn aakhry dw myn \""byat\"" kay lyay \""byat\"" hay۔ ahmd awr abw daod kay ayk nskhay myn \""khwn say aalwdh hay\"" 1 ky jgh \""ayk nam dya gya hay۔\"" abwdaod khtay hyn kh \""ayk nam dya gya hay\"" pr aawaz blnd hay۔"""""
"4154","mhmd by 'tmam by. hsyn nay aly bn ka hwalh dya۔ abw talb khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay satwyn dn hsn kay lyay ayk bkry ky qrbany ky awr frmaya: fatmh rzy allh anha ka sr mndwao awr as kay balwn ka wzn chandy myn sdqh krw۔ tw anhwn nay as ka wzn kya tw yh ayk drhm ya ayk drhm ka kchh hsh nkla۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay lykn as ky snd pwry trh say mrbwt nhyn hay kywnkh mhmd bn . aly by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh aly bn kay zmanay myn pyda nhyn hwyay thay۔ abw talb۔"
"4155","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay satwyn dn hsn awr hsyn rzy allh anh kay lyay ayk myndha qrban kya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ nsayy khtay hyn kh dw myndhay hyn۔"
"4156","amrw by shayb nay apnay wald kay hwalay say kha kh an kay dada nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say aqyqh kay baray myn pwchha gya tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh allh taalyٰ kw rshth twtna psnd nhyn hay، gwya wh as nam kw napsnd krtay hyn۔ awr frmaya kh agr ksy kay han bchh pyda hw awr wh as ky trf say qrbany krna chahay tw wh lrkay ky trf say dw awr ayk lrky ky trf say qrbany kr skta hay، abwdaod awr nsayy nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4157","abw rafa rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw hsn rzy allh anh kay kan myn azan dytay hwyay dykha۔ aly nay jb fatmh kw jnm dya۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn shyh hay۔"
"4158","brydh nay kha: zmanh jahlyt myn jb hm myn say ksy kay han lrka pyda hwa tw as nay ayk bkry ky qrbany ky awr as ka sr as kay khwn say mlaya۔ lykn jb aslam aaya tw hm nay satwyn dn ayk bkry ky qrbany ky، as ka sr mndwaya awr asay zafran say mla dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya، awr razyn nay mzyd kha، \awr as ka nam rkha۔\"""""""
